<title>INDONESIA: Andayani 9-mth net plunges.</title>
<headline>Andayani 9-mth net plunges.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   30.99 vs 51.13</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)    97 vs 160</p>
<p>    Net sales			   162.09 vs 170.97</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   28.99 vs 49.24</p>
<p>Note: PT Andayani Megah, a member of the Gajah Tunggal Group, is a tyre-cord manufacturer.</p>
</text>
